<section class="story">
  <div class="container story__grid">
    <figure class="media media--16x9">
      {% img "assets/images/projects/cavitation/test_setup_01.png", "Cavitation test setup" %}
    </figure>

    <div class="story__content">
      <h2 class="story__title">Why Cavitation Matters</h2>
      <p class="story__text">
        Flow restrictions can behave very differently once cavitation starts. For propulsion systems,
        predicting that onset is important because it affects stability, component sizing and test interpretation.
      </p>
      <p class="story__text">
        The work focused on building a practical understanding of cavitation behavior using available
        measurements and visual evidence.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

